r . I know you ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "It's fine with me if we go to the Latin Club . I like Latin Music.The only thing I never want to do again is listen to country rock.What was that bar called ?"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "Oh . You mean Jerry's , over on the east side.That wasn't my idea going there ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "No . It was that friend of yours , Melissa.Her and all her lousy country music Cds . Yecch !"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "It's true . I would never go there again either.Country music is a nightmare . So is it the Latin Club ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Yes . You have to teach me the samba , and the tango , and whatever else they do .\nMaybe ."}]}]}
