{"schemaVersion": "bedrock-conversation-2024", "system": [{"text": "You are a helpful conversational assistant. Engage in natural, friendly dialogue."}], "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "Everyone wants to be financial lose kill . You must invest your savings if you planed to retire rich . I ’ m thinking about buying stocks . It can be a good investment if I can manage well . What do you say ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "I partly agree with you . Buying stocks is not difficult , but making money consistently from buying stock is very difficult . Even professionals don ’ t find it easy , so be careful . Anyway , people like us need help with investing . Why not do some online research ? There are data , reports and discussion forums to educate people on how to invest . In addition , you need to visit an established website that offers stock charts .\nI just watched the investment TV program last weekend . It has become a very hot topic these days . Actually I am not even a beginner ."}]}]}
