pt American Express ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Yes . May I know the number ?\nThank you , Mr . Johnson . You ’ Ve made a guaranteed reservation at the Guangzhou xx Hotel , from April 16th to 20th for 5 nights . If you can ’ t arrive as schedule , please inform us before 6 p . m . on April . hank you for calling and we look forward to serving you"}]}]}
