{"schemaVersion": "bedrock-conversation-2024", "system": [{"text": "You are a helpful conversational assistant. Engage in natural, friendly dialogue."}], "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "For sure ! I didn ’ t really understand some of the technical jargon they used in the film when they talked about social security in the US ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Like what ?"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "Well , they mentioned how people put away money in something called a 401K ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Yeah , I know it sounds weird , but a 401k is a type of retirement plan that allows employees to save and invest for their own retirement . Through a 401K , you can authorize your employer to deduct a certain amount of money from your paycheck and invest it in the plan . Everyone tries to contribute as much as possible so that when you retire , you can rest peacefully on your nest egg ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "That ’ s interesting and logical I guess . In my country , we also have to contribute to a government-run retirement fund , but most people don ’ t really trust it so they just invest in properties or things like that ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "That seems a bit unstable don ’ t you think ?\nI ’ Ve been thinking of doing that lately ! I don ’ t want some banker to run off with my money !"}]}]}
