lright . And I want to consider your eye shadow too.Do you have a color chart I can look at ?"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "We have a very wide selection of colors.And our eye shadow is specially designed to moisturize the skin.So it is very gentle on your eyelids . Would you like to sample some ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Oh , sure . I will need to clean off my own eye shadow first .\nThank you ."}]}]}
