union as president ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "That sounds very good . How do you see your career development ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "After a few years of gaining experience in the company and furthering my professional qualifications I'd like to put my experience and skills to use in management . I want to become a supervisor in your R & D department ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "Have you anything to ask about the job ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Yes . Do you offer any opportunities for further study ?"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "Yes . If you undertake additional courses , provided these are approved , and you complete them successfully , you can claim back part , quite a large part , 75 % of the costs you incurred . Not just the fees , - traveling and other expenses too ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "That's fine ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "Anything else ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "No .\nThank you , Mrs . Smith . I do hope the answer will be favorable . Goodbye ."}]}]}
