{"schemaVersion": "bedrock-conversation-2024", "system": [{"text": "You are a helpful conversational assistant. Engage in natural, friendly dialogue."}], "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "You must like negotiating a lot . People are saying , you are a super negotiator ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Ha , I am flattered . Actually , when it comes to negotiate , you don ’ t need to like it . You just need to understand how it works ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "I am not good at it by any means . Give me some advice ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Well , generally speaking , if you want to change someone ’ s mind or understand his position , you have to put yourself in his shoes . Understand his need and the cost for his need . And then you work together to find a solution .\nOk , as John after Kennedy put it , let us never negotiate out of fear , but let us never fear to negotiate ."}]}]}
