 records . Alright . How much does it cost ?"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "It costs only 19 dollars a year for a card ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Whoa ! That's expensive ! It should be cheaper .\nYeah , maybe . Alright . Give me an application form ."}]}]}
