{"schemaVersion": "bedrock-conversation-2024", "system": [{"text": "You are a helpful conversational assistant. Engage in natural, friendly dialogue."}], "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "I wish to make it clear at the outset that this matter of labels is entirely our problem ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "I should say it is something we have never come across before ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "The Federal Food and Drug Administration , or the FDA as we call it for short , imposes a whole set of regulations on the import of food products to the United States . Over the years , they have become so rigid and complicated that they are now quite a head - ache for us importers ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "In my opinion , overly strict regulations are just another way of restricting imports ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "Ah , there's something in what you're saying . According to the present FDA regulations , the Ma Ling Labels then cannot be used if the lichee is to be offered for import into the United States ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Why not ? Our cannedlichee and canned provisions have already been widely sold in various markets abroad , and the Ma Ling Label has now been accepted by most of overseas customers and importers . Is it quite impossible for you to use the Ma Ling labels as they are ?"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "I'd be quite willing to if I could , but we must comply with the label requirements according to our law , or we can't clear the consignment of lichee through the Customs ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "In that case , what can we do to help you ? Have you any suggestions ?\nDo you think that's the only way out ? You know we usually do the labeling , as we are responsible for the brand labels of our products ."}]}]}
