nk so ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "What ideas do you have if we employ you ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Ever since I was a young girl , I ’ Ve been clever with my hands . I ’ Ve always enjoyed doing detailed work . If I could use that ability to make your products a little better and to benefit the company , I would be happy ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "Do you have any particular conditions that you would like the company to take into consideration ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "No , nothing in particular ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "If you are employed by us , how are you going to do your part of the work ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "I'll first get further information about our goals , ways , counterparts and management , etc . . Then I ’ ll make my plan . And then I ’ ll go with all my effort to see it is realized ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "If you fail to do your work well , what are you going to do ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "I ’ ll report it honestly . I ’ ll give a correct analysis . I may quit the job - and pay compensation . But I have my way to judge whether I fail ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "What do you think if you do not have much spare time on this job ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "People are supposed to work hard within regular work time , especially when it is an important work that is highly paid for . I don ’ t mind work over spare time if it is paid for ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "What are your expectations from working on this job ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Getting more experience with a widely-known company like yours . Using my speciality in marketing and management . And getting advancement in salary and position . Show my enterprise , confidence and character in passing ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "If you were choosing a person for this job , what kind of individual would you select ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "I would select the individual that has the most qualifications among all the applicants . He doesn ’ t have to be the person if we have to fill the vacancy . But he has to be the best , even if we have to pay him higher .\nI will feel it is a pity . But I will not feel so bad . I will go for other interviews until I am employed satisfactorily . Hopefully before I find another position , you will call me back ."}]}]}
