tallation is charged separately ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Yes , I suppose I should get used to it.But I'm not really willing to spend more than 6000 dollars for this.We haven't even opened yet ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "I understand , Ma'am ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "And the other company that gave me a quote on this said they could do it for 4000 dollars ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "It's a question of quality , Ma'am . At that price , you would not get good equipment . I've been in this business for almost twenty years . I know what happens.If you don't get quality air conditioning now , you will just have to replace the system after two years ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "I will tell you what I can agree to.If you can quote me a price of 6000 dollars , installation included , I can accept ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "Well ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "You do seem like a better company than the other one.So I am willing to pay more than 4000 for you . But I won't pay more than 6000 .\nGood . I hope we can arrange the contract as soon as possible ."}]}]}
