r", "content": [{"text": "Well , maybe . But I like the little kid who played Manakin Skywalker . I can't imagine anyone else playing that role ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "I liked him too . He is so cute ! You know , even though I was slightly disappointed , I can't wait for the next episode . I wonder when they ’ re going to start making it and when it ’ s scheduled for release ?"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "I've no idea . But looking at the success of Star Wars episode , I've a strong feeling production for the next episode will be selling pretty soon . I hope It will be even better than this one ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "I hope so , too .\nOkay , let's go !"}]}]}
