ic research seminars and exchanges between domestic and international experts are often organized there ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Very interesting . That's really a place I must go and see . And then ?\nMr . Chen himself has become an authority in this area , and master of butterfly sample making , I should say ."}]}]}
