wise I'd look like a ballon soon ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "You're quite slim . In fact , if you were one of those starlets , the movie company would say you have a fabulous figure .\nOh , my shoes pinch me . Let's find a seat and sit a while ."}]}]}
