der graduate study in business in the future . I think my goals will become more clear as I gain experience in sales and marketing ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "Good . Do you know anything about this company ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Yes , a little . As you mentioned just now , yours is an American capital company . As far as I know your company is a world famous one which produces cosmetics and skincare products ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "Have you got anything to ask me ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Will traveling be required in this position ?"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "Yes ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "How often ?\nThat's fine ."}]}]}
