}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "What can I say ? I am a passionate guy ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "Well , I hope you can find something else to be passionate about ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "You want to go out with me and you know it .\nOk , I get the message . Hey , do you have any sisters ?"}]}]}
