t": [{"text": "Well ... actually ... I was thinking about asking Jess to marry me ... I ’ Ve just been so nervous ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Well sir , I believe your fifth anniversary is a great time to propose !\nFabulous ! We should look at engagement rings then ! Now that ’ s a whole other section ."}]}]}
