{"schemaVersion": "bedrock-conversation-2024", "system": [{"text": "You are a helpful conversational assistant. Engage in natural, friendly dialogue."}], "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "Thank you . I ’ Ve worked pretty hard to be able to list those accomplishments ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "You ’ Ve got plenty of training and experience . I wonder if you could tell me something about your goals . Where do you see yourself ten years from now ?"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "To be honest , I don ’ t plan in that much detail . My goals tend to be general ; I define success according to the job at hand . I see myself advancing as I succeed , but I don ’ t necessarily dwell on"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "interesting ! And how do you feel about decision-making ? Are you an independent thinker , or do you depend more on your superior for direction ?"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "That depends a bit on the problem at hand . There are certain situations in which a manager can give a general directive , and expect his employees to know how to take the initiative on the detail"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Sounds good . Everyone is taking about teams these days . Can you describe your role as a member of a sales team ?\nSo , your experience is as impressive in practice as it is on paper ."}]}]}
