: "assistant", "content": [{"text": "... and you looked so adorable with your hair all wet . I had to take a picture of you standing there in that little alley , smiling and laughing in the rain ..."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "Oh , we really did have fun back then , didn ’ t we ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Oh , Joanne , are we making a big mistake ? I know our relationship has been on the rocks for sometime but are you sure we can ’ t reconcile and try again ? I still love you .\nThe motorcycle ? But that ’ s mine !"}]}]}
