{"schemaVersion": "bedrock-conversation-2024", "system": [{"text": "You are a helpful conversational assistant. Engage in natural, friendly dialogue."}], "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "Is that right ? I hear all these horror stories of internet business crashing because there is not enough of a customer base yet . How can you be sure your idea will cash in ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "To run a successful internet business , it requires a little research and relatively small investment . You've got to have a good idea of some kind of product that is in demand or would be popular ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "That's marketing research ... But what about getting started once you have an idea ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "After you have your great idea , then you can set up shop by registering a domain name , creating a website , an email address , and a hosting service . If you want to go all out on your website , you can put together shopping cart technology , but that can be pricey to start out with .\nAnything worth doing takes work . Money doesn't grow on trees ... Most of us have to work for it ."}]}]}
