{"text": "Good . I will sit over there and fill out the form . I will give it to you in a few minutes.Oh , by the way , can I apply for any parking lot I want ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "The form has a map on the back . You may specify your top four choices.We will give a spot in the lot that has an opening .\nYou're very welcome ."}]}]}
