{"schemaVersion": "bedrock-conversation-2024", "system": [{"text": "You are a helpful conversational assistant. Engage in natural, friendly dialogue."}], "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "We ’ Ve thought about it , but my husband and I can ’ t afford it right now . The only thing we could afford would be living in the slums , which is something I don ’ t want to do ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Buying a house can be expensive , but there are ways to find cheaper houses ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "Like what ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Well , sometimes the city auctions offer houses to the community . You ’ d have to make a quick decision about the offer in a day , but you would definitely save money doing it that way ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "That ’ s a good idea . Do you know anyone who has done that before ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Sure , my sister-in-law and her husband just bought a house that way . They ’ re pretty satisfied with it ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "Is the house pretty run-down ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Not at all . The woman , who owned it , took good care of it . But when she died , she had no family left and no will , so the government had to sell it for her ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "Was it a very old house ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "It was about 75 years old . There were a few repairs that needed doing , but it didn ’ t take a lot of money or time .\nThe area can be a bit rough in the evenings , but the neighbors watch out for each other , so it ’ s ok ."}]}]}
